{
  "id": "REV.12",
  "number": "12",
  "bookId": "REV",
  "reference": "Revelation 12",
  "copyright": "The Holy Bible, New International Version® NIV® Copyright © 1973, 1978, 1984, 2011 by Biblica, Inc.® Used by Permission of Biblica, Inc.® All rights reserved worldwide.",
  "verseCount": 17,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "12",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "REV 12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "12",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The Woman and the Dragon",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A great sign appeared in heaven: a woman clothed with the sun, with the moon under her feet and a crown of twelve stars on her head.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "She was pregnant and cried out in pain as she was about to give birth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then another sign appeared in heaven: an enormous red dragon with seven heads and ten horns and seven crowns on its heads.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Its tail swept a third of the stars out of the sky and flung them to the earth. The dragon stood in front of the woman who was about to give birth, so that it might devour her child the moment he was born.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "She gave birth to a son, a male child, who \"will rule all the nations with an iron scepter.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "And her child was snatched up to God and to his throne.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The woman fled into the wilderness to a place prepared for her by God, where she might be taken care of for 1,260 days.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then war broke out in heaven. Michael and his angels fought against the dragon, and the dragon and his angels fought back.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But he was not strong enough, and they lost their place in heaven.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The great dragon was hurled down—that ancient serpent called the devil, or Satan, who leads the whole world astray. He was hurled to the earth, and his angels with him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then I heard a loud voice in heaven say:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "REV 12:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Now have come the salvation and the power",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "REV 12:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and the kingdom of our God,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "REV 12:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and the authority of his Messiah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "REV 12:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "For the accuser of our brothers and sisters,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "REV 12:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "who accuses them before our God day and night,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "REV 12:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "has been hurled down.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They triumphed over him",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "REV 12:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "by the blood of the Lamb",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "REV 12:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and by the word of their testimony;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "REV 12:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "they did not love their lives so much",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "REV 12:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "as to shrink from death.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore rejoice, you heavens",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "REV 12:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and you who dwell in them!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "REV 12:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "But woe to the earth and the sea,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "REV 12:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "because the devil has gone down to you!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "REV 12:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "He is filled with fury,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "REV 12:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "because he knows that his time is short.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When the dragon saw that he had been hurled to the earth, he pursued the woman who had given birth to the male child.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The woman was given the two wings of a great eagle, so that she might fly to the place prepared for her in the wilderness, where she would be taken care of for a time, times and half a time, out of the serpent's reach.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then from his mouth the serpent spewed water like a river, to overtake the woman and sweep her away with the torrent.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But the earth helped the woman by opening its mouth and swallowing the river that the dragon had spewed out of his mouth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the dragon was enraged at the woman and went off to wage war against the rest of her offspring—those who keep God's commands and hold fast their testimony about Jesus.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "REV.13",
    "number": "13",
    "bookId": "REV"
  },
  "previous": {
    "id": "REV.11",
    "number": "11",
    "bookId": "REV"
  }
}